    <section class="home-vendor-model-bg">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-md-7 my-auto">
            <h2>One Vendor Model</h2>
            <p>Local Procurement can be challenging for customers being remotely located and very challenging as the
              commodities bought fall under various categories and spread over several hundreds or thousands of vendors
              across the region. The large supplier base spread possesses various challenges for buyers as below. The
              requirement is immediate and must be delivered hassle free in a very short duration of time sometime in
              days.</p>
            <p>PetroaArab have come up with One Vendor Model which will eliminate dealing with numerous vendors reduces
              PR-PO processes and hence reduce the overall process and acquisition cost for customer.</p>
            <div id="Ntext">
              <ul class="list fw-bold ps-1">
                <li>Focus on strategic purchasing. Hence, we developed One Vendor Models where we dedicate team, and
                  they manage all your local buying and supply chain and payments terms. This has helped many of our
                  customers to reduce suppliers’ transactions and hence reduced operational expense of the company. In
                  this model we commit delivery within from 24Hrs-72Hrs Max based on product availability and location.
                </li>
                <li>We are aware of the local supplier market and since we are buying for various customer, we take
                  advantage of negotiated prices.</li>
                <li>We help our customers to have the grip on their tail spends.</li>
                <li>Timely reporting and analysis. Insight into even the smallest one-time purchases</li>
                <li>Help customer in uncontrolled expenses</li>
                <li>Lower risk of rejections and due to quality or inaccurate items.</li>
                <li>Most Important is Conduct and Compliance</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <a id="toggle" class="home-vendor-model-btn">Read More</a>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-5 hidden-xs">
            <img src="img/home-vendor-model-bg.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt="Petrochemical Company in Saudi Arabia"
              title="Petrochemical Company in Saudi Arabia" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
